From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] qcom: add native rear LG AWB statistics primitives

Carry the three rear sensors' screening thresholds and lux-dependent
weight tables into typed configurations. Implement BG conversion,
startup preservation, screening counters, weight interpolation and
nearest-primary-reference selection with the factory rounding order.

